606
00:33:37,140 --> 00:33:41,140
因为你之前看到看涨订单流，期待趋势延续
Because, you know, you had that bullish order flow. You're looking for that move to continue.

607
00:33:41,440 --> 00:33:46,140
但如果没延续，这就是出场信号，对吧
But if it doesn't continue, that's your sign to get out. Right.

608
00:33:46,140 --> 00:33:47,432
如果你在逼近新高
If you're coming up to new

609
00:33:47,432 --> 00:33:48,724
好，你在不断创新高
highs, all right, you're making these

610
00:33:48,724 --> 00:33:51,739
突然看到市场出现抛压
new highs. Then all of a sudden you see supply coming into the market.

