00:34:32,840 --> 00:34:37,340
所以市场伤害不到你预设风险之外。
So the market can't hurt you beyond your predefined risks.

623
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:42,640
那市场一逆你方向，你为何开始慌？
So why do you start to panic when the market starts to move against you?

624
00:34:42,940 --> 00:34:43,840
你已经设了止损单。
You have a stop in there.

625
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:47,640
