636
00:35:30,372 --> 00:35:32,272
交易不成功，别怪别人。
Don't blame others for your trade not working out.

637
00:35:32,672 --> 00:35:33,572
谁的错都不是。
It's nobody's fault.

638
00:35:34,772 --> 00:35:37,872
别抱怨市场让你交易失败。
Do not complain about the market for your trade not working out.

639
00:35:38,072 --> 00:35:39,272
不是市场的错。
It's not the market's fault.

640
00:35:39,572 --> 00:35:41,472
为你的交易决策负责。
Be accountable for your trading decisions.

641
00:35:42,372 --> 00:35:46,872
相信自己，不仅是决策，还有执行交易的能力。
Trust yourself not only in your decision making, but also your ability to execute your trades.

642
00:35:47,272 --> 00:35:49,172
如果你不相信自己，就别交易。
If you don't trust yourself, you shouldn't be trading.

643
00:35:49,972 --> 00:35:53,372
你会相信自己在暴风雪里开车吗？
Would you trust yourself to go drive in a snowstorm?

644
00:35:53,872 --> 00:35:57,772
如果不相信自己能在暴风雪里开车，你就不会开。
If you don't trust yourself to drive in a snowstorm, you're not going to drive in a snowstorm.

645
00:35:57,772 --> 00:35:58,872
你会待在家里。
You're going to stay in the house.

646
00:35:59,972 --> 00:36:05,172
同样，如果不相信自己的交易决策，为什么还要交易？
Just as if you don't trust yourself in your trading decisions, why are you trading?

647
00:36:05,272 --> 00:36:05,872
别交易。
Don't trade.

648
00:36:05,872 --> 00:36:09,872
找点别的事做，别拿钱冒险。
Find something else to do with your time than risk money.

649
00:36:11,372 --> 00:36:12,572
说到底，
At the end of the day,

