00:36:12,572 --> 00:36:13,772
如果你不相信自己，
if you don't trust yourself and

651
00:36:13,772 --> 00:36:15,972
还把钱放在风险里，你会输光的。
you have money at risk, you're going to lose that money.

652
00:36:16,472 --> 00:36:17,572
这可不是你想要的。
